=== the stronger-than-pressure comparison is the Constructor's own comparator with originalOrder neutralised ===
OK   EXHAUSTIVE (225 pairs of importance x deadline-today / earlier / later / none): `compareAbovePressure` is TIE exactly when the real comparator ties with originalOrder equalised
OK   where the stronger dimensions decide, the real comparator agrees on the direction for EVERY originalOrder combination (originalOrder can never overrule them, and the helper never reads it)
OK   the facts carry no originalOrder at all: a projection of an intent has only importance and (optionally) deadline
OK   deadline TODAY outranks importance, then importance, then an earlier / present deadline (the three dimensions, in the comparator's own order)
=== the gates, in order ===
OK   ELIGIBLE (all gates pass; the owner differs only by weaker originalOrder, which the facts do not even carry): PRESSURE_ELIGIBLE_AGAINST_ALL_FINAL_OWNERS
OK   PRESSURE GATE: pressure NONE with real contention and a final Deferral is NOT_PRESSURED (NONE can never become a promotion candidate)
OK   PRESSURE GATE: no pressure on record for the candidate fails closed (UNAVAILABLE -> NOT_PRESSURED); pressure is never inferred
OK   CONTENTION GATE: LAST_KNOWN_OPPORTUNITY + final Deferred + NO trace event (e.g. deferred for another reason) is NO_CONTENTION -- contention comes from the trace only
